  "provenance": [
    "DS13737 Rev10 exact STM32U575ZIT6Q LQFP144-SMPS inventory111GPIO; Table26 Q-column and Figure18 independently reviewed. PB12/PC4/PC5/PG11 absent; pin inventory never authorizes PCB routes. Source PDF SHA256f3de0b5e62ad45ed46bdaf8dbebec358edae1fd3305c558c5835589085454345.",
    "Official CMSIS Device U5 v1.4.3 pin624374fa1e21ca195d6f2102ac0caaa50d0ea4c8: M33F/DSP,IRQ126,priority4. RM0456 Rev7 sections3.5.2/3.7.1 exact8MPU/8SAU regions (DS13737 up-to16 wording is not the exact tuple); selected single-state TZEN0 does not authorize SAU access. ICACHE/DCACHE are SoC peripherals, not SCB cache lines.",
    "DS13737 Rev10 sections3.5/3.15: default SRAM1 192KiB at NS0x20000000; GPDMA1 main-bus path, LPDMA1 restricted lower bus/SRAM4 path. Security, privilege, clocks, link and cache ownership required separately; no implemented DMA mode. Remaining physical SRAM2/3/4/BKPSRAM and Secure aliases are deliberately not selectable in this minimal provider, never double-counted.",
    "Official reset clock template MSIS4MHz range4, no HSE/PLL. TIM2 IRQ45 PSC3 reserves1MHz; selected profile requires TZEN0 and no bank swap without ever modifying option bytes. Flash2MiB consists of dual-bank256 total8KiB pages; no programming provider.",
    "ES0499 Rev12 June2026 section2.21.1 noisy receive glitch limitation on W/U has no software workaround; official measures are a noiseless line or external glitch filter; IRQ bytes cannot infer noise immunity. Section2.21.2 DMAT toggling pending-request erratum is not claimed solved, DMA modes excluded.",
    "RM0456 Rev7 sections11.4.8/61.4.4/61.7.2: IWDG unprescaled LSI only, irreversible start before PR/RLR synchronization,4-bit PR /4..1024. DS13737 Rev10 Table84 full-temperature characterizedLSI30.4..33.6kHz; not measured. Exact GPIOA-H inventory excludes PB12/PC4/PC5/PG11; PH0/PH1/PH3 only. USART2 PA2/PA3 AF7 source Table27,IRQ62 CMSIS; external wiring unobserved."
  ]
